===persian===

پدرم پای آتش آواز خواند...
تن آتش... دود شد...
جانِ آتش ماند...
۱۳۷۲/۲/۱۶

===machine===

My father sang at the foot of the fire...
The body of the fire... turned to smoke...
The soul of the fire stayed...
1372/2/16

===lantern===

My father sang at the foot of the fire.
The body of the fire turned to smoke.
The soul of the fire stayed.

1372/2/16

